   <table:table table:name="GENERALNE NAPOMENE" table:style-name="ta1">
    <office:forms form:automatic-focus="false" form:apply-design-mode="false"/>
    <table:table-column table:style-name="co1" table:default-cell-style-name="Default"/>
    <table:table-column table:style-name="co2" table:default-cell-style-name="ce1"/>
    <table:table-column table:style-name="co1" table:number-columns-repeated="16382"/>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro1">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" table:number-columns-repeated="16382"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro1">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="1" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Za A3, A4, A7 nije ništa još predano.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" table:number-columns-repeated="16382"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="2" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Za A1, A2, A6 smo već predali ASB koliko znam? Samo je ostalo predati editabilne fajlove? U tom slučaju bi bilo dobro sve editabilne dwg-ove preglednih nacrta iz mog/AA radnog prebaciti u Izlaznu -&gt; As built da budu zajedno s pdf-ovima. Također bi bilo dobro baciti oko na dwg/docx ostalih stvari koje predajemo, a koje su već u Izlaznoj, jer mislim da za njih nismo pripremali da budu editabilni, odnosno nismo ih &quot;čistili&quot;</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" table:number-columns-repeated="16382"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="3" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>3</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Za A1, A2, A6 su editabilni eplani također u mom/AA radnom (ti folderi bi trebali biti isti), samo je pitanje hoćemo ih ubacivati da stoje u Izlaznoj</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" table:number-columns-repeated="16382"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="4" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Komentirali smo da se popis doc za A6 i A7 razlikuje u nečemu, tipa kontrolna topologija, tako da na to treba baciti oko</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" table:number-columns-repeated="16382"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro1">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="5" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>5</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>A3, A4 zadnji eplani, ujedno i editabilni, su u Tehničkoj</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" table:number-columns-repeated="16382"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro1">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="6" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>6</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>A7 editabilni eplani su na čekanju dok Fran ne updatea prijevode</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" table:number-columns-repeated="16382"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="7" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>7</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Za editabilne fajlove A126 kojima se ne poklapa datum s pdf-om je razlog što se nije mijenjao sadržaj, samo su pripremljene clean verzije fajlova za slanje</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" table:number-columns-repeated="16382"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro1">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="8" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>8</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" table:number-columns-repeated="16382"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro1">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="9" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>9</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" table:number-columns-repeated="16382"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro1">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="10" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>10</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" table:number-columns-repeated="16382"/>
    </table:table-row>
